    Use GITHUB_OUTPUT in RPM repository workflow (#8171)
    
    The workflow still passes the version between steps using the
    ::set-output workflow command. GitHub deprecated this in 2022 and warns
    on every run that it will be disabled. Once that happens, the version
    silently becomes empty and the repository metadata would be created
    under a path like `oc-/x86_64`.
    
    Write the output to the GITHUB_OUTPUT environment file instead.
    
